PAVÉ (RECTANGULAR PARALLELEPIPED)
---------------------------------
Dimensions: a, b, c
Volume: V = a*b*c

n-D Hyperrectangle:
Intervals: [a_i, b_i]
Lengths:   L_i = b_i - a_i
Volume:    V = Π_i L_i

Mapping:
S: axis frame, lengths L_i
I: multiplicative composition V = Π_i L_i
D: ∂V/∂L_k = Π_{i≠k} L_i (optional)
